DTEND:20250522T212500Z
DTSTAMP:20250522T193000Z
UID:BxMxNEbOLt
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 101 mins (1h41m)\n\nIn this Ukraine-shot tale of fin
 ding connection under the most devastating and isolating of circumstances\
 , a space trucker thinks he’s the last living person in the universe…u
 ntil a call from a distant space station sets him on a course across the c
 osmos. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/u-are-the-universe\n
 \nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Downtown (Sun 25 May\, 4:15 PM)
