DTEND:20250525T062500Z
DTSTAMP:20250525T040000Z
UID:nNaQrMKhLH
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 131 mins (2h11m)\n\nIt’s 1967 Czechoslovakia\, and
  technician Tomás has just started working at the country’s most renown
 ed radio station. But as the Soviets crack down on any dissenting opinions
 \, Tomás must either become an informant or protect his activist younger 
 brother in this nerve-wracking journalism thriller. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps
 ://www.siff.net/festival/waves\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Shoreline CC The
 ater (Wed 21 May\, 8:30 PM)\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
