DESCRIPTION:Duration: 82 mins (1h22m)\n\nIn this camp classic from 1972 bu
 rsting with lo-fi queer cinema energy\, Warhol Factory muse and trans actr
 ess Holly Woodlawn stars as a small-town girl hoping to make it big in New
